title: SelaCantorPreview
---
Sela: Those rings are pulling against it. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Three links feeding a lock on the head. I can open those. #emotion:Determined
Sela: The grooves in the walls follow its bend. Not the collar. #emotion:Worried
Taren: The passage wants to turn. #emotion:Neutral
Sela: I'll mark the new line. Cut the links first. #emotion:Determined
Taren: And give it room when the lock opens. #emotion:Tender
